<h2 id="open-banking">Open Banking masterclass</h2>
<p>"Open Banking: transforming banking and the financial industry" - a compact and in-depth masterclass, typically an intensive two-day course in person, tailored to the participants: what Open Banking is and why it is happening, its key elements (APIs and consent), implementation, business models and the consequences for banks and their customers, use cases, and the outlook from Open Banking to Open Finance and beyond. It has been delivered around the world, in Europe, the US, the Middle East and beyond. For senior management, product development, strategy, marketing, data services, retail and corporate services, legal and compliance, and IT in banks, regulators, FinTechs and service providers.</p>
